<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that pair came in at 68% of normal on the middle, and so far in 2026 March to April came in at 36%. Every one of the 8 grids had its driest year in 2007, with grid 17308 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
